---
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const docs = await getCollection("docs");
---

<BaseLayout docs={docs} pageKind="home">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="grid-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="signal"><i></i> Python 3.13+ · v0.1.2</div>
      <h1>一套仓储，<br /><span>连接存储。</span></h1>
      <p>用一致的 Repository 接口连接 SQLAlchemy、SQLModel 与 Elasticsearch，同时保留每个后端的原生能力。</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="primary" href="/docs/quickstart/">阅读文档 <span>→</span></a>
        <button class="install" type="button" data-copy="pip install ormate"><code>pip install ormate</code><span data-copy-label>复制</span></button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="contract" aria-label="从统一仓储到多种存储的流程">
      <div class="contract-head"><span>repository.py</span><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
      <pre><span class="purple">users</span> = <span class="blue">ModelRepository</span>(
    SQLAlchemyAdapter(db),
    <span class="gold">User</span>, <span class="gold">UserRead</span>,
)

active = <span class="purple">await</span> users.find(
    <span class="blue">eq</span>(<span class="green">"active"</span>, <span class="gold">True</span>)
)</pre>
      <div class="runtime-flow"><span>MODEL</span><b></b><span>REPOSITORY</span><b></b><span>ADAPTER</span><b></b><span>STORE</span></div>
      <div class="pulse p1"></div><div class="pulse p2"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="manifesto">
    <div class="section-label">01 / ONE REPOSITORY</div>
    <h2>统一常用路径。<br />保留后端能力。</h2>
    <p>Repository 负责输入输出转换，Adapter 负责存储操作。业务代码获得稳定接口，复杂查询仍然可以回到原生能力。</p>
  </section>

  <section class="features">
    <div><span>01</span><h3>统一仓储语义</h3><p>创建、查询、更新、删除与统计使用同一套紧凑的异步接口。</p></div>
    <div><span>02</span><h3>类型贯穿全程</h3><p>Pydantic ReadModel 驱动字段投影、验证与最终返回类型。</p></div>
    <div><span>03</span><h3>存储自由切换</h3><p>SQLAlchemy、SQLModel 和 Elasticsearch 共享 DSL，也支持原生查询。</p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="docs-listing" aria-labelledby="docs-title">
    <div class="section-label">02 / DOCUMENTATION</div>
    <h2 id="docs-title">从模型到事务，<br />逐层理解 ormate。</h2>
    <nav aria-label="文档章节">
      {[...docs].sort((a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order).map((entry) => (
        <a href={`/docs/${entry.id}/`}>
          <span>{String(entry.data.order).padStart(2, "0")}</span>
          <strong>{entry.data.title}</strong>
          <i>↗</i>
        </a>
      ))}
    </nav>
  </section>

  <section class="closing">
    <div class="section-label">READY WHEN YOU ARE</div>
    <h2>更少适配代码。<br />更清晰的边界。</h2>
    <a href="/docs/quickstart/">五分钟开始使用 <span>↗</span></a>
  </section>

  <footer class="home-footer">
    <a class="brand" href="/"><img src="/assets/ormate-logo.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" /><span>ormate</span></a>
    <span>Unified repositories for Python.</span><span>MIT · 2026</span>
  </footer>
</BaseLayout>
